    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII loader for a PKCS#11 shared library. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Loads the library with dlopen/LoadLibrary, resolves C_GetFunctionList, calls C_Initialize, and on destruction calls C_Finalize and unloads the library.</para>
<para>Non-copyable; movable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
